{"questions":[{"question_id":"1l225eqxq","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 1 Offline","year":2012,"examDate":2012,"subject":"physics","chapter":"laws-of-motion","chapterGroup":"mechanics","topic":"motion-on-an-inclined-plane","type":"mcqm","marks":4,"negMarks":2,"permalink":"pa-small-block-of-mass-01-kg-lies-on-a-fixed-inclined-pla-jee-advanced-physics-units-and-measurements-654kokeukqrgrpp4","content":"<p>A small block of mass 0.1 kg lies on a fixed inclined plane PQ which makes an angle <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> with the horizontal. A horizontal force of 1 N acts on the block through its centre of mass as shown in the figure. The block remains stationary if (take g = 10 m/s<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Laws of Motion Question 10 English\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l24kzzly/a3572ecb-ed9b-4d52-966b-004c89e54766/4eb95a60-bf03-11ec-8fbf-67f2639a0a45/file-1l24kzzlz.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = 45<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 436.6 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &gt; 45<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 436.6 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and a frictional force ats on the block towards P."},{"identifier":"C","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &gt; 45<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 436.6 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and a frictional force ats on the block towards Q."},{"identifier":"D","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &lt; 45<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 436.6 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and a frictional force ats on the block towards Q."}],"correct_options":["A","C"],"explanation":"<p>The forces acting on the block are F = 1 N towards the left, weight mg = 0.1 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 10 = 1 N downwards, normal force N, and the frictional force f. Resolve F and mg along and perpendicular to the inclined plane.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Laws of Motion Question 10 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l253yb13/25549356-80e2-49f8-9abb-4a60f58d2825/6d61b670-bf4d-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253yb14.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>When <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.061ex\" height=\"1.618ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 469 715\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = 45<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 436.6 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the net force that brings the block down is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.334ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"38.716ex\" height=\"3.291ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 17112.5 1454.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(676,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1373.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2429.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3307.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D454\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D454\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3954,0)\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(394,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(672,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5182,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5348.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6039.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7040.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7955.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"63\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-63\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\" transform=\"translate(944,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9293.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(9460.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10207.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(11263,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(521.6,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-519.2) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,82.9)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"500\" height=\"42.4\" x=\"853\" y=\"840.5\"></rect></g></g><rect width=\"1156.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12882,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(13882.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(521.6,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-519.2) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,82.9)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(853,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"500\" height=\"42.4\" x=\"853\" y=\"840.5\"></rect></g></g><rect width=\"1156.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(15556.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(16612.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Thus, the block is stationary if <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.328ex\" height=\"1.674ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -718 3239.1 740\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(746.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1802.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1033,404.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. When <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.09ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.328ex\" height=\"1.715ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -718 3239.1 758\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D703\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D703\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(746.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1802.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1033,404.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the force <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.355ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.628ex\" height=\"1.894ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -680 2929.4 837.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(676,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1373.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2429.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, and hence the block has a tendency to move down. Thus, the frictional force f acts on the block upwards i.e., towards Q.</p>"}]}